{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER A WORLD</h2>Explore the potion shop Wilds risen out of The Cascade.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/c0d0a998da4f80d2ea56925581a16843.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=113 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEAL A TORN LANDSCAPE</h2>Uncover the mystery of the lost shopkeeper.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/23055a4065e2843c10286c2583014732.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=113 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POTION APPRENTICE</h2>Seek out recipes and harvest ingredients to make potions and unlock abilities<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/8fce65e44614b98a0d36064e5435fb7c.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=112 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE APPEARANCE</h2>Unlock character parts for a new look.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/f928b89d5d3a7b9fff6984e197159b09.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=112 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAIN KNOWLEDGE AND SKILLS</h2>Upgrade weapons and tools<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/281098b83f279ec586504b6defa7c53a.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=112 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE A NETWORK OF GROW FIELDS</h2>As your Field network grows so do those of your rivals elsewhere in the shop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/8ee15002da6353fedbb1f157dba10788.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=113 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRIBE A RIVAL</h2>Make a Bribe for a rival to change their opinion to agree with yours.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/678e80fd8db88ef6624b55e898dc19e9.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=113 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY PIECES</h2>Uncover what happened to the shopkeeper, meet the villagers, encounter rivals and write your own self into the place.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115180/extras/e0bb56479666cabc75db210451471700.avif?t=1734045669\" width=616 height=113 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Acorns Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/887000e94c73c1deca610f8a54edf4f3669fadfc.jpg"},{"name":"Aphids Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/de1586bc3858bf14446920db958d4d6154d2c192.jpg"},{"name":"Bamboo Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/23c2d55240eb82838d80268a2fe6b6898b4bccee.jpg"},{"name":"Bees Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/0cdc1ee487d946b6335b96d0a2f8052c9c91002a.jpg"},{"name":"Bells Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/ebd8830c5e58932c6c1570118325e0895573110c.jpg"},{"name":"Birds Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/83c65cbf65e0e25ca940db7a24d03717a87f2316.jpg"},{"name":"Butterflies Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/fc8dca38daed1876571c42f0a64fd86cbbc41ab3.jpg"},{"name":"Cake Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2115180/fb66d25991696d73921188c67366ff07b5267ff5.jpg"},{"name":"Cats Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat